  "question": {
    "text": "A convex lens shown in the figure is made up of two types of transparent materials. A point sources of light is placed on its principal axis. If reflections from the boundaries between layers are ignored, the lens will form<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/9d490464-232a-4a92-a368-eb213a0feddd-image.png\" style=\"width: 90px; height: 261px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
